      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The town square surrounds Dole Park, home to Lānaʻi Community Hospital, the island’s only hospital.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        30
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/L%C4%81na%CA%BBi_City%2C_Hawaii",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Lānaʻi Cultural & Heritage Center houses traditional artifacts and teaches visitors about the island’s folklore and customs.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        1
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.meethawaii.com/media-room/hawaiian-islands-fact-sheets/lanai/",
      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Lānaʻi City feels like a historic upcountry village, where mom‑and‑pop shops let you meet locals and support community businesses.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        7
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.meethawaii.com/media-room/hawaiian-islands-fact-sheets/lanai/",
      "category": "other",
      "quality": "poor",
      "qualityReason": "editorial_filler"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The town boasts an Olympic‑size public pool, a state‑of‑the‑art movie theater, a supermarket, a public library, and a community health center.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        6
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/L%C4%81na%CA%BBi_City%2C_Hawaii",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
